00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:54,880
How so?

651
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:59,910
Well, the language we choose in these moments, like deciding whether to say the connection is bad...

652
00:28:59,890 --> 00:29:04,220
versus it was something on my end, it isn't just technical jargon.

653
00:29:04,620 --> 00:29:07,410
It subtly navigates the whole social situation, doesn't it?

