00:30:40,430 --> 00:30:53,230
sound or you know the lack of it that classic opening line of a video call is often can you hear me right and it's interesting we always say hear not listen oh yeah

682
00:30:53,430 --> 00:30:55,210
Our source material points out that distinction.

683
00:30:55,490 --> 00:31:00,000
Here is about the physical ability, like the sound waves reaching your ears, your equipment working.

