00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:04,130
Listen implies you're actually paying attention, making a choice.

685
00:31:04,470 --> 00:31:05,550
So when you ask, can you hear me?

686
00:31:06,250 --> 00:31:11,320
You're really just checking if the tech is working well enough for the sound to sort of arrive.

687
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:12,340
That makes total sense.

