00:32:04,050 --> 00:32:04,630
Yeah.

714
00:32:04,650 --> 00:32:05,470
If you're not quite sure.

715
00:32:05,610 --> 00:32:06,270
Just a little nudge.

716
00:32:06,290 --> 00:32:08,470
And how do you, you know, politely ask them to check?

717
00:32:08,560 --> 00:32:12,760
Well, phrases like, can you check if your mic is muted, work great.

718
00:32:13,620 --> 00:32:17,130
Or maybe more generally, could you check your settings?

719
00:32:17,370 --> 00:32:17,610
Right.

720
00:32:17,910 --> 00:32:18,550
Check settings.

721
