Implies looking inside the program's options.

722
00:32:21,690 --> 00:32:22,230
Yeah.

723
00:32:22,250 --> 00:32:24,720
We saw an example scenario, actually, where a call started.

724
00:32:25,120 --> 00:32:25,980
Someone couldn't hear.

725
